    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061108.0124\n\nKUALA LUMPUR, Nov. 8 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nMalaysia stock market closes higher\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on Malaysia stock market closed higher on Wednesday.\n\nAt the closing bell, the benchmark Kuala Lumpur Composite Index (KLCI) gained 4.01 points to 1007.29.\n\nThe Second Board Index dropped 0.74 of a point to 87.03, the Industrial Index rose 23.43 points to 2119.66 and Mesdaq edged down 0.29 of a point to 115.50.\n\nLosers led gainers 419 to 389 while 322 counters traded unchanged.\n\nVolume stood at 984.13 million shares worth 1.274 billion ringgit (344.32 million U.S. dollars), up from 875.15 million shares worth 1.22 billion ringgit (330 million U.S. dollars on Tuesday.",
